present before the attribute blocks.

````````````````````````````````.example
# H1 __{#my__id1}
## H2 **{#my**id2}
### H3 `{.code` }
#### H4 ~~{.strike~~ }
.
<h1 id="my__id1">H1 __</h1>
<h2 id="my**id2">H2 **</h2>
<h3 class="code`">H3 `</h3>
<h4 class=".strike~~">H4 ~~</h4>
