````````````````````````````````.example
# H1__ {#my__id1}
## H2** {#my**id2}
### H3` {.code` }
#### H4~~ {.strike~~ }
.
<h1 id="my__id1">H1__ </h1>
<h2 id="my**id2">H2** </h2>
<h3 class="code`">H3` </h3>
<h4 class=".strike~~">H4~~ </h4>
